--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
libshumate (the crate)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The native extension under ext/libshumate links the libshumate crate, the
gir-generated gtk4-rs bindings over the GNOME map library. This gem is bindings
for it and nothing else: every method it defines calls a function of that crate.

